<title>USA: Vincam names Carlen president.</title>
<headline>Vincam names Carlen president.</headline>
<dateline>CORAL GABLES, Fla. 1997-06-17</dateline>
<text>
<p>Vincam Group Inc said Tuesday that it has named John Carlen to the new position of president and chief operating officer.</p>
<p>Carlen will join Vincam from Paychex Inc, where he served as executive vice president and was responsible for payroll services, sales and electronic commerce operations and oversaw all acquisition activities.</p>
